  "releaseNotes": "## What's Changed\n* fix texture alpha blending (mostly) by @trevis in https://github.com/Chorizite/Chorizite/pull/130\n* better texture sampling by @trevis in https://github.com/Chorizite/Chorizite/pull/131\n* use sdl for clipboard, fix ctrl/shift key mapping. Fixes #120 by @trevis in https://github.com/Chorizite/Chorizite/pull/132\n* Launcher backend no longer throws exception when attempting to play a sound and no IDatReader is found by @trevis in https://github.com/Chorizite/Chorizite/pull/137\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Chorizite/Chorizite/compare/release/0.0.7...release/0.0.8",
